1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,640
Right into the bend, the soot lets go.

2
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:04,680
The rod bends with the pipe instead of catching.

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:06,400
Nine flexible rods. They don't get stuck.

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:10,080
Screw them together, one by one, to 3.69 meters behind the stove.

5
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:13,800
Clean it yourself between sweeps. Build only the length you need.

6
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,280
Get your chimney sweep kit and get your draft back.
